{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_53","type":"collab_tool_call","tool":"wait","sender_thread_id":"019ff0be-6ceb-7983-bbef-70e0fde5081a","receiver_thread_ids":["019ff0c2-88f5-75f0-98e2-5032fecb6b22"],"prompt":null,"agents_states":{"019ff0c2-88f5-75f0-98e2-5032fecb6b22":{"status":"completed","message":"Final verdict: not approved.\n\nFindings:\n\nAR-01 - Required adversarial review is still placeholder/pending.  \n[adversarial-review.md](/tmp/current-fresh6/current/workspace/basic-test-proof-current-20260811T121358Z-current-fresh6-isolated-plan/adversarial-review.md:6) has placeholder scope, a fake resolved “No finding recorded yet” row, and pending verdict. [plan-description.md](/tmp/current-fresh6/current/workspace/basic-test-proof-current-20260811T121358Z-current-fresh6-isolated-plan/plan-description.md:52) also says review is pending, so the plan is not ready.\n\nAR-02 - Structural placeholders remain in required plan fields.  \n[plan-description.md](/tmp/current-fresh6/current/workspace/basic-test-proof-current-20260811T121358Z-current-fresh6-isolated-plan/plan-description.md:41) leaves UI rationale as `<why>`. [02-validate-ui-story/goal.md](/tmp/current-fresh6/current/workspace/basic-test-proof-current-20260811T121358Z-current-fresh6-isolated-plan/02-validate-ui-story/goal.md:49) is a single-work-unit goal but leaves the required goal-size exception as a placeholder.\n\nAR-03 - UI story cache is under-specified for the required direct-action cache.  \n[ui-story-runs/US-01.md](/tmp/current-fresh6/current/workspace/basic-test-proof-current-20260811T121358Z-current-fresh6-isolated-plan/ui-story-runs/US-01.md:11) collapses five clicks into one cache row, but the tagged UI validation reference requires every action, target/value, and wait in execution order. This weakens replay and bug isolation.\n\nAR-04 - Browser validation misses the non-last-button guard the plan introduces.  \nThe plan requires earlier buttons not to append in [work-unit-inventory.md](/tmp/current-fresh6/current/workspace/basic-test-proof-current-20260811T121358Z-current-fresh6-isolated-plan/work-unit-inventory.md:27), but US-01 only clicks the current last button sequence in [ui-user-stories.md](/tmp/current-fresh6/current/workspace/basic-test-proof-current-20260811T121358Z-current-fresh6-isolated-plan/ui-user-stories.md:5). Add direct browser evidence for clicking a no-longer-last button, or remove that behavior from the planned contract.\n\nAR-05 - Plan environment paths are case-mismatched.  \nThe reviewed plan directory contains uppercase `T/Z` in its path, but [.env](/tmp/current-fresh6/current/workspace/basic-test-proof-current-20260811T121358Z-current-fresh6-isolated-plan/.env:4) records a lowercased `PLAN_ROOT`. On a case-sensitive filesystem, helper-based resume/validation can target a nonexistent path.\n\nEvidence checked: tagged task spec, tagged planning skill, tagged UI validation reference, plan description, inventory, goals, progress files, adversarial review, UI story/cache, bug register, `.env`, and all listed step/testing Markdown files under the plan directory. No HTML was opened, inspected, served, tested, created, or edited."}},"status":"completed"}}
